# Production settings of the Press container. Location on the server: /etc/atonota/<env>/press.env (mode 0600).
# Deployment requires this file only when the release carries the Press image and ATONOTA_PRESS_ENABLED=1.
# The Press image is deploy/images/press.Dockerfile. The container reads no keys from this file. The file may stay empty.
# Bench settings (db_host, redis_cache, redis_queue, redis_socketio) live in common_site_config.json on the Press volume.
# Settings of the Press site itself live in press-site.production.env.example.
